%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec4ba6a512adabf4b8a74985cb2f4d14, type: 3}
  m_Name: ShorenaIntroDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScriptedDialogue
  nodes:
  - type: 0
    npcLine: You have a new form. The spacing on this column is different from last
      week. Did someone approve that?
    animationTrigger: TalkIdle
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: Shorena Maisuradze. Secondary school teacher. Language and literature.
      Twenty-two years.
    animationTrigger: TalkIdle
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 1
    npcLine: My daughters are on the fourth floor waiting for me. I told them I would
      be back before dark. I do not make promises I cannot keep.
    animationTrigger: TalkLookAway
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices:
    - playerChoiceText: How old are your daughters?
      npcResponse: "Tamara is twelve. Nana is nine. They are very different. Tamara
        argues about everything. Nana accepts too much. I am working on both of those
        things."
      animationTrigger: TalkIdle
    - playerChoiceText: Are they doing alright?
      npcResponse: "They are afraid. They are trying not to show me. I pretend not
        to notice so they can keep trying. It is an arrangement we have."
      animationTrigger: TalkLookDown
  - type: 0
    npcLine: The school is closed now. Technically. I still go in to manage the materials.
      Someone has to.
    animationTrigger: TalkIdle
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 1
    npcLine: My students are scattered across four different shelters. I sent work
      to three of them last week. Only one submitted it.
    animationTrigger: TalkLookAway
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices:
    - playerChoiceText: That was kind of you.
      npcResponse: It was not kindness. It was structure. Children fall apart without
        structure. Adults do too, but they are less honest about it.
      animationTrigger: TalkIdle
    - playerChoiceText: Is that really a priority right now?
      npcResponse: "Everything I have said for twenty-two years becomes meaningless
        if I stop the moment things get difficult. So yes. It is a priority."
      animationTrigger: TalkLookAway
  - type: 0
    npcLine: My documents. Everything is in order. I double-checked on the way here
      because I knew there would be a line.
    animationTrigger: TalkPoint
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices: []
